<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kolosus negotiating food processing sale.</title>
<headline>Kolosus negotiating food processing sale.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kolosus Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it was negotiating the sale of a minority interest in one of its food processing operations.</p>
<p>Shareholders were therefore urged to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
